cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below, and please also cite the
  tau-bench / tau2-bench / tau-voice papers listed in the README.
title: "℞-bench: A Benchmark for Medical AI Voice Agents"
authors:
  - given-names: "Sohan"
    family-names: "Shingade"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sohan-shingade/rx-bench"
url: "https://sohan-shingade.github.io/rx-bench/"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark measuring whether voice agents launder uncertainty into the
  medical record: 111 tasks across 8 suites in a synthetic medical
  front-office domain for the tau2-bench framework, scored against the
  committed chart state rather than the conversation.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - voice agents
  - patient safety
  - large language models
